@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft JhengHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classBorderColor #555555
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFBEA
skinparam noteBorderColor #B39B4D
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
hide circle
hide empty members
title A3：兩種做法，取出時編譯器各知道什麼？

class "ArrayList<SampleSource>" as L #F4F4F4 {
  + get(index : int) : <b>SampleSource</b>
}
class "SampleGroup<T extends SampleSource>" as G #DFF3E3 {
  + get(index : int) : <b>T</b>
  + totalSamples() : int
}
interface SampleSource <<interface>> #F4F4F4 {
  + getSamples() : int
}
class HeavyRover #F4F4F4 {
  + getEnergy() : int
  + getDrillCount() : int
}
L ..> SampleSource : 元素型態
G ..> SampleSource : <b>T 的上限</b>\n（不是繼承）
SampleSource <|.. HeavyRover
note bottom of L
  可以混放、可以加總，
  但 get 回來只保證是 SampleSource：
  <color:#C0392B>getEnergy() 呼叫不到</color>
end note
note bottom of G
  SampleGroup<HeavyRover> 的 get → <b>HeavyRover</b>：能查能源
  上限保證每個 T 都有 getSamples()，
  所以 totalSamples() 能加總
end note
@enduml
